 data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Meine Wohnung ist nicht hell.</b></div>sein 뒤의 형용사를 부정할 때 nicht는 형용사 바로 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> Gehst du heute nicht ins Kino? — (응, 안 가) <span class=\"qblank\"></span>, ich bleibe zu Hause.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Ja</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Nein</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Doch</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Kein</button></div><div class=\"qe\">독일어 Ja/Nein은 문장의 내용에 맞춰요. 안 가는 게 맞으니까 Nein이에요.<br>한국어 '응'에 끌려 Ja를 쓰지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Herr Lee arbeitet heute nicht im Büro&quot;,&quot;Heute arbeitet Herr Lee nicht im Büro&quot;,&quot;Im Büro arbeitet Herr Lee heute nicht&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">이 씨는 오늘 사무실에서 일하지 않아요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Büro</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Lee</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">heute</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Herr</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">im</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">arbeitet</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Herr Lee arbeitet heute nicht im Büro.</b></div>시간 표현 heute는 nicht보다 앞, 장소 표현 im Büro는 nicht 뒤에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;meinen&quot;],[&quot;nicht&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> Ich finde <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(ich · Schlüssel 남성)</span> Schlüssel <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">내 열쇠를 못 찾겠어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich finde <b>meinen</b> Schlüssel <b>nicht</b>.</div>소유관사가 붙은 명사는 kein이 아니라 nicht로 부정해요.<br>문장 전체 부정이라 nicht는 목적어 뒤, 끝에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> '우리는 더는 쾰른에 살지 않아요.'</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Wir wohnen nicht in Köln mehr.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Wir wohnen nicht mehr in Köln.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Wir wohnen kein mehr in Köln.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Wir wohnen noch nicht in Köln.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">'더는 ~ 않다'는 nicht mehr예요. noch nicht는 '아직 ~ 않다'예요.<br>nicht mehr는 장소 표현 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;kein&quot;],[&quot;sondern&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> Das ist <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Tee · 남성)</span> Tee, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> Kaffee.</div><div class=\"qko\">이건 차가 아니라 커피예요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das ist <b>kein</b> Tee, <b>sondern</b> Kaffee.</div>관사 없는 명사 Tee는 kein으로 부정해요. 남성 1격이라 끝이 없어요.<br>앞의 부정을 바로잡을 때는 sondern이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;noch&quot;],[&quot;nicht&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> Paula ist <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> da.</div><div class=\"qko\">파울라는 아직 안 왔어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Paula ist <b>noch</b> <b>nicht</b> da.</div>'아직 ~ 않다'는 noch nicht예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> Ich habe <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Bruder und <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Schwester. (남자 형제도 여자 형제도 없어요)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) keinen … keinen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) nicht … nicht</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) keinen … keine</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) kein … keine</button></div><div class=\"qe\">명사를 부정하니까 kein이에요. 끝은 명사마다 따로 정해요.<br>Bruder는 남성 4격 keinen, Schwester는 여성 4격 keine예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wir fahren nicht nach Rom sondern nach Mailand&quot;,&quot;Nicht nach Rom sondern nach Mailand fahren wir&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 로마가 아니라 밀라노로 가요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">nach</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Mailand</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">fahren</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Rom</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">sondern</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">nach</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wir fahren nicht nach Rom, sondern nach Mailand.</b></div>일부만 부정할 때는 그 말(nach Rom) 바로 앞에 nicht를 놓고 sondern으로 바로잡아요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Wir kennen ihn nicht.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Ich trinke nicht Milch.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Sie ist nicht die Chefin.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Ich spreche kein Japanisch.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">관사 없는 물질명사 Milch는 kein으로 부정해요 — Ich trinke keine Milch.<br>언어 이름은 kein, 정관사 명사와 대명사는 nicht로 부정해요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Doch&quot;],[&quot;Nein&quot;],[&quot;nicht&quot;],[&quot;keine&quot;],[&quot;Doch&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> A: Ist Tom nicht zu Hause? — B: <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\">, er ist im Garten.<br>A: Und Sara? Ist sie da? — B: <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">, sie ist <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"> da.<br>A: Hat Tom <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(Zeit · 여성)</span> Zeit? — B: <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 5\">, er hat Zeit.</div><div class=\"qko\">톰 집에 없어? — 아니, 정원에 있어. / 그럼 사라는? 사라는 있어? — 아니, 사라는 없어. / 톰 시간 없어? — 아니, 시간 있어.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · A: Ist Tom nicht zu Hause? — B: <b>Doch</b>, er ist im Garten.<br>A: Und Sara? Ist sie da? — B: <b>Nein</b>, sie ist <b>nicht</b> da.<br>A: Hat Tom <b>keine</b> Zeit? — B: <b>Doch</b>, er hat Zeit.</div>부정 질문을 뒤집어 '있다'고 답할 때는 Doch예요.<br>긍정 질문에 '없다'고 답하면 Nein + nicht, 관사 없는 Zeit는 keine로 부정해요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich leihe es ihm heute nicht&quot;,&quot;Heute leihe ich es ihm nicht&quot;,&quot;Es leihe ich ihm heute nicht&quot;,&quot;Ihm leihe ich es heute nicht&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 오늘 그것을 그에게 빌려주지 않아요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">leihe</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">heute</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">es</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">ihm</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Ich</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich leihe es ihm heute nicht.</b></div>대명사끼리는 4격(es) → 3격(ihm), 그다음 시간 표현이 와요.<br>문장 전체 부정의 nicht는 그 뒤, 맨 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;kein&quot;],[&quot;mehr&quot;],[&quot;Niemand&quot;],[&quot;nichts&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> Ich habe noch Brot. → Ich habe <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> Brot <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">.<br>Jemand ist da. → <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"> ist da.<br>Sie isst etwas. → Sie isst <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 빵이 더는 없어요. / 아무도 없어요. / 그녀는 아무것도 안 먹어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich habe noch Brot. → Ich habe <b>kein</b> Brot <b>mehr</b>.<br>Jemand ist da. → <b>Niemand</b> ist da.<br>Sie isst etwas. → Sie isst <b>nichts</b>.</div>noch + 명사의 반대는 kein … mehr예요.<br>jemand의 반대는 niemand, etwas의 반대는 nichts이고, nicht를 더 붙이지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> '나는 프랑스어를 잘하지는 못해요.' (조금은 해요)</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Ich spreche kein Französisch.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Ich spreche nicht gut Französisch.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Ich spreche gut Französisch nicht.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Ich spreche kein gut Französisch.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">부사 gut을 부정하니까 nicht를 gut 바로 앞에 놓아요.<br>kein Französisch는 '프랑스어를 전혀 못한다'는 뜻이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> '나는 내일이 아니라 오늘 우리 할머니를 찾아뵈어요.'</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Ich besuche meine Oma morgen nicht, aber heute.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Ich besuche nicht meine Oma morgen, sondern heute.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Ich besuche meine Oma nicht morgen, sondern heute.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Ich besuche keine Oma morgen, sondern heute.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">morgen만 부정하니까 nicht를 morgen 바로 앞에 놓고 sondern으로 바로잡아요.<br>소유관사가 붙은 meine Oma는 kein으로 부정하지 않아요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"30\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 30</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"